#CHLOEAI:1
TYPE="path_rules"
GLOB="src/main/**"

LANGUAGE_RUNTIME:
- Java 21 LTS (fill in exact version, e.g. "21.0.3")
- Spring Boot 3.x (fill in exact version)
- Maven or Gradle — (fill in which, do not switch mid-project)

BUILD:
- mvn clean verify (Maven) or ./gradlew build (Gradle)
- mvn checkstyle:check / ./gradlew spotlessCheck for lint

STYLE_CONVENTIONS:
- Google Java Format enforced by Spotless — do not hand-format
- Checkstyle rules enforced — do not suppress without a comment
- Use constructor injection, not field injection (@Autowired on fields)
- Records preferred over POJOs for simple data carriers (Java 16+)
- Checked exceptions for recoverable conditions; RuntimeException for bugs

FORBIDDEN_PATTERNS:
- No field injection (@Autowired on fields) — use constructor injection
- No System.out.println() — use SLF4J logger
- No hardcoded credentials or connection strings in source
- No business logic in @RestController — delegate to @Service

EXPLICITLY_NOT_TOUCHING:
- (fill in: generated code, migration scripts, etc.)
